        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>10\" Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nVery modern 10\" center to center offset stainless steel glass door handles. Easy to grip rectangular pull handle that is very comfortable in a warm Satin Stainless Steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>2 Foot Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-square-door-handle-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>36\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/48-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>4 Foot Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/canaropa-20T10EB-32D_size.gif?v=1704354590\" width=\"430\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"10 inch Stainless Rectangular Offset Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for 10\" Modern Rectangular Offset Glass Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-1/4\" (286 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 10\" (254 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\" (91 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-5/8\" (67 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Point: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" x 3/4\" Rectangular</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/20T10EB-32D.pdf?v=1691095007\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-CAN20T10EB-32D 10\" Rectangular Offset Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on <b>1/4\" to 5/8\" thick glass doors</b> with a <b>1/2\" diameter hole in glass</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pull Handles)</b>\r\n</p>",
